Hello All of you Code Hackers (Chris, Tom, Yuval, etc..),
   My quest has been the gradual reworking of the godly NH 3.1 to acheive
greater wackiness, less loopholes, and much tougher monsters for high level
players.  I've come quite a ways in my modifications but I'm always looking
for more...
   The nethack I've designed so far is not for those new to the game but
old pros looking for more of a challenge.  Some of my mods:
   -All of Chris Heborth's (sp?) and the NH -- gangs monsters plus some
even meaner ones.
   -A few new artifacts and objects.
   -While NH3.1 already treated AC beyond -9 as just damage reduction, i
stopped even that at -15 (a lesser AC doesn't mean anything).
   -Death in polymorphed form equals DEATH PERIOD.
   -All of the Quest Nems have been beefed up a bit and have similar clones
the player might run into lower in the dungeon (especially when the wizard
summons them).
   -The Bell of Openning / endless wraiths and giant summoning has been
removed.
   -Weapons like Dragonbane and Demonbane are actually "useful".
   -etc...

   For those intrested in the MSDOS executable or aspects of my code please
email me!  For those who have implemented their own code changes that make
the game nastier but still feasible please email me about it and if it
sounds FUN I'd love the bit of code to make it possible.
   Some stuff I'm really looking for:
   -Does anyone know how to make successful level drains from Stormy or
vampires equal some minor (1-4) healing?
   -Does anyone have implemneted monsters with totally original forms of
attack?

                                              Hope to hear from ya soon,
